<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR slips to 12.19 from 12.20pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR slips to 12.19 from 12.20pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>ATHENS, Jan 28 Reuter) - The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month eased to 12.19 from 12.20 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) edged lower to 11.69 from 11.70 percent.</p>
